  "title": {
    "rendered": "Faith Jordan"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This young global Impactor is far more than just another pretty face, join us tomorrow as we round out the week and kick off the month with some incredible youthful insights!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hello everyone, my name is Faith Marie Jordan. I’m from a small town in southwest Michigan and 19 years old. Through my 19 years of life I’ve faced a lot of adversity. My dreams are to be able to motivate others, change lives and offer inspiration through my testimonies. I am a type 1 diabetic, sexual assault survivor and I stand for much more. One of my goals is to change the modeling industry and “beauty standards.” Im hoping my modeling and acting goals can give me a gateway into change!</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
